### Chatbot API requests
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains' built-in HTTP Client.
### After login/register, copy the returned "token" into @token below to authorize the rest.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8011
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhNTY1YTQ3My02ZDhhLTRmMTMtOWU5My1lYWVkYzhmYTYzM2EiLCJlbWFpbCI6InlvdUBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc4NjcwNzgxMiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2Nzk0MjEyfQ.U9vBI4tqSK2XbR_-QHPPDTZJaA3DxottrviKHZJMXWLg1nVO9ADXruj9AiMZhQtz

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health


### Register a new user
# Body fields are "email" and "password" (there is no separate username field).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Login (returns { token, tokenType, expiresInSeconds })
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Send a chat message (starts a new conversation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "give me video generate ai names"
}


### Send a chat message into an existing conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Tell me more about that.",
  "conversationId": "paste-conversation-id-here"
}


### Send a chat message with streaming (Server-Sent Events)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Stream a short poem about the ocean."
}


### List the current user's conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Get one conversation's full message history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/paste-conversation-id-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Upload a document for RAG (requires RAG_ENABLED=true and the postgres profile)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="handbook.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./handbook.pdf
--boundary--


### List uploaded documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Delete a document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/paste-document-id-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
